{"id": 62984, "date": "2025-12-10T04:00:04", "date_gmt": "2025-12-10T12:00:04", "guid": {"rendered": "https://estreetshuffle.com/?p=62984"}, "modified": "2026-08-04T18:57:02", "modified_gmt": "2026-08-05T01:57:02", "slug": "kingdom-of-days-december-10-2", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://estreetshuffle.com/index.php/2025/12/10/kingdom-of-days-december-10-2/", "title": {"rendered": "December 10"}, "content": {"rendered": "<p><strong>1971:\u00a0</strong>The Bruce Springsteen Band is in residence at the Student Prince in Asbury Park.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23211\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1971-12-10/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?fit=1164%2C1402&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1164,1402\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1971-12-10\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?fit=758%2C913&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23211 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?resize=758%2C913&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"913\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?w=1164&amp;ssl=1 1164w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?resize=249%2C300&amp;ssl=1 249w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?resize=850%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 850w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1971-12-10.png?resize=768%2C925&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1972:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and the as-yet-unnamed E Street Band play their last night of a six-night, two-shows-nightly stand at Kenny&#8217;s Castaways in New York City.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"14651\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1972-12-10/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/1972-12-10.jpg?fit=500%2C479&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"500,479\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1972-12-10\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/1972-12-10.jpg?fit=500%2C479&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-14651 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/1972-12-10.jpg?resize=500%2C479&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"479\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/1972-12-10.jpg?w=500&amp;ssl=1 500w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/1972-12-10.jpg?resize=300%2C287&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>1975:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and the E Street Band bring the Born to Run Tour to Bucknell University in Lewisburg, Pennsylvania.</p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"23212\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1975-12-10/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-10.png?fit=1264%2C1125&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1264,1125\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"1975-12-10\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-10.png?fit=758%2C674&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-23212 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-10.png?resize=758%2C675&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"675\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-10.png?w=1264&amp;ssl=1 1264w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-10.png?resize=300%2C267&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-10.png?resize=1024%2C911&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/1975-12-10.png?resize=768%2C684&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"6675\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/1975-1210/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/1975-1210.jpg?fit=1066%2C1600&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1066,1600\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;: