&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<audio class=\"wp-audio-shortcode\" id=\"audio-62984-9\" preload=\"none\" style=\"width: 100%;\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"audio/mpeg\" src=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/03-Borin-In-The-USA.mp3?_=9\" /><a href=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/03-Borin-In-The-USA.mp3\">https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/03-Borin-In-The-USA.mp3</a></audio>\n<p><strong>2006:\u00a0</strong>Bruce and Patti attend rockabilly legend Wanda Jackson&#8217;s concert at the Asbury Lanes in Asbury Park.</p>\n<audio class=\"wp-audio-shortcode\" id=\"audio-62984-10\" preload=\"none\" style=\"width: 100%;\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"audio/mpeg\" src=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/2020-07-29-Bruce-E-Street-Radio-DJ-set-09.mp3?_=10\" /><a href=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/2020-07-29-Bruce-E-Street-Radio-DJ-set-09.mp3\">https://estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/2020-07-29-Bruce-E-Street-Radio-DJ-set-09.mp3</a></audio>\n<p><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"46868\" data-permalink=\"https://estreetshuffle.com/asbury_park_press_tue__dec_12__2006_/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Asbury_Park_Press_Tue__Dec_12__2006_.jpg?fit=1702%2C2200&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1702,2200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Asbury_Park_Press_Tue__Dec_12__2006_\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Asbury_Park_Press_Tue__Dec_12__2006_.jpg?fit=758%2C980&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-46868 size-full\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Asbury_Park_Press_Tue__Dec_12__2006_.jpg?resize=758%2C980&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"758\" height=\"980\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Asbury_Park_Press_Tue__Dec_12__2006_.jpg?w=1702&amp;ssl=1 1702w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Asbury_Park_Press_Tue__Dec_12__2006_.jpg?resize=232%2C300&amp;ssl=1 232w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Asbury_Park_Press_Tue__Dec_12__2006_.jpg?resize=792%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 792w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Asbury_Park_Press_Tue__Dec_12__2006_.jpg?resize=768%2C993&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Asbury_Park_Press_Tue__Dec_12__2006_.jpg?resize=1188%2C1536&amp;ssl=1 1188w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Asbury_Park_Press_Tue__Dec_12__2006_.jpg?resize=1584%2C2048&amp;ssl=1 1584w, https://i0.wp.com/estreetshuffle.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Asbury_Park_Press_Tue__Dec_12__2006_.jpg?w=1516&amp;ssl=1 1516w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 758px) 100vw, 758px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>2007:\u00a0</strong>The Magic Tour continues its Scandinavian leg, stopping at the Globe Arena in Stockholm for a night, where Clarence&#8217;s son Christopher joins the band for &#8220;Dancing in the Dark.&#8221;</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pyLicU8OX5k?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5pMGrnSv_HA?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>2010:\u00a0</strong><em>The Promise\u00a0</em>is certified gold by the Recording Industry Association of America.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent&#038;listType=playlist&#038;list=OLAK5uy_mCQxEZoH6hfjwIUf-N0BouhY-AR5jONxc\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>2012:\u00a0</strong>Bruce plays his first-ever show in Mexico, as the North American leg of the Wrecking Ball Tour comes to a close in Mexico City.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/G7w5O-GEPbU?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/roXg4IZn3sU?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><strong>2020: </strong>Bruce and most of the E Street Band rehearse for their upcoming <em>Saturday Night</em> <em>Live</em> appearance at NBC&#8217;s Studio 8H in New York City.(Garry and Soozie do not attend; Jack Daley sits in for Garry on bass.)</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ikqaz8u8mbA?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p>While he&#8217;s in the neighborhood, Bruce zips over to Studio 6A, where he chats with Jimmy Fallon on\u00a0<em>The Tonight Show</em>.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"758\" height=\"427\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cnBQgbdQ5OM?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p>Finally, that evening Bruce appears on a television special to announce <em>Time Magazine&#8217;s </em>Person of the Year<em>.</em></p>\n<div id=\"v-vuRi9mPE-1\" class=\"video-player\"><div id='v-vuRi9mPE'></div></div>\n<p><strong>2023:\u00a0</strong>Bruce&#8217;s scheduled show in San Francisco is postponed to the following March due to his peptic ulcer disease.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n", "protected": false}, "excerpt": {"rendered": "<p>Bruce celebrates the tenth anniversary of the Human Rights Now! Tour in Paris, wins an important lawsuit in the UK, plays his first-ever concert in Mexico, and more.</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 1, "featured_media": 31293, "comment_status": "open", "ping_status": "open", "sticky": false, "template": "", "format": "standard", "meta": {"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking": false, "_jetpack_newsletter_access": "", "_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs": false, "_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id": 0, "_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content": false, "_jetpack_feature_clip_id": 0, "_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content": false, "footnotes": "", "jetpack_publicize_message": "", "jetpack_publicize_feature_enabled": true, "jetpack_social_post_already_shared": true, "jetpack_social_options": {"image_generator_settings": {"template": "highway", "default_image_id": 0, "font": "", "enabled": false}, "version": 2}, "jetpack_post_was_ever_published": false}, "categories": [2], "tags": [1974, 1303, 162, 369, 187, 677, 1569, 428, 1972, 1155, 360, 1977, 1978, 630, 92, 302, 1975, 1973, 527, 77